	(text "POWER INPUT: User USB-C (on the User USB-C sheet) -> STUSB4500 PD sink (NVM: 5 V / 9 V / 15 V at 3 A, I2C 0x28).\nVBUS_EN_SNK drives the FDS9435A P-FET (SO-8), so VBUS_USER only appears once a contract is in place.\nRS201 (20 mR) -> PM1 CH1. JP201 (default open) lets the Dev USB VBUS feed the charger for bench work.\nVSYS (pin 22) is tied to GND as DS12499 says when unused; ALERT is wired-OR with the charger INT (CHG_PD_INT)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 254 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5d12bd22-12cb-4738-96cd-55695ba9b101")
	)
